Marine layer around 1000 feet with low cigs rapidly retreating
towards the coast. Expect all terminals to be VFR by 19z except
KMRY and KHAF. Low cloud deck to surge back inland tonight as next
shortwave trough approaches with slight deepening of the marine
layer overnight into Sunday.

