afternoon/evening. Low cigs to return after 05z tonight and
lasting at least through 18z Sunday.

SFO Bridge Approach...Approach is clear and will stay that way at
least through 06z tonight.

Monterey Bay Terminals...Low cigs to pull back to the coast by
19z. Low cigs may linger near KMRY for much of the day and then
spread back inland by 02z and down the Salinas Valley.

